            <span class="bg-brand-gold text-brand-navy text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Complete Guide</span>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-brand-navy mt-4 mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5">The Complete Guide to High-Myopia Eyewear</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-ink-3 line-clamp-2" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.7">The extra measurements above -6.00D, lens thickness, astigmatism, contact lenses and RGP, and why the fundus is for an ophthalmologist to check.</p>
          </a>
          {extraPosts.map(post => (
            <a href={`/en/blog/${post!.slug}/`} class="rounded-2xl p-7 border border-brand-ink/10 hover:border-brand-gold transition-colors group" style="background:#f7f3ec">
              <span class="bg-brand-light text-brand-navy text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">{post!.data.tag}</span>
